  "bodyClass": "body-10",
  "body": "<h1 class=\"heading-43\">ROBOTS</h1><h3 class=\"heading-48\">Take a walk through a gallery of Team 8033's creations.</h3><img src=\"/assets/2930d9770989f23c-65c406fc4708288443691749_Robobanner2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2540px) 100vw, 2540px\" srcset=\"/assets/0e8138c980f3054b-65c406fc4708288443691749_Robobanner2-p-500.png 500w, /assets/6c2b36d584d23101-65c406fc4708288443691749_Robobanner2-p-800.png 800w, /assets/ed69ae1c55fe82b6-65c406fc4708288443691749_Robobanner2-p-1080.png 1080w, /assets/129df27ae3135556-65c406fc4708288443691749_Robobanner2-p-1600.png 1600w, /assets/2860fd535d95a57f-65c406fc4708288443691749_Robobanner2-p-2000.png 2000w, /assets/2930d9770989f23c-65c406fc4708288443691749_Robobanner2.png 2540w\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-46\"><section class=\"section-18\"><h1 style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"heading-49\">2020 </h1></section><section class=\"section-39\"><img src=\"/assets/eb6d90a2e9ca153c-65c90ad374651f26dcfdca8f_Nessie-2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-49\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-40 w-container\"><h1 class=\"heading-47\">Nessie</h1><p class=\"paragraph-21\">Team 8033's Inaugural Robot was designed, constructed, and tested in 2019 by our founders. Although it was unable to compete due to the COVID-19 lockdown, our team bonded in the process of making it. It features a low cargo shooter, a dual-piston extending intake, and a control panel with acolor sensor underneath.<br></p><a href=\"/robots/nessie\" class=\"button-9 w-button\">More Information</a></div></section><section class=\"section-22\"><h1 style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"heading-49\">2021 </h1></section><section class=\"section-39 w-clearfix\"><img src=\"/assets/b7c2061184fe1ddf-65c90b4dbccbcf82a1835d3f_Whirlpool.JPG\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/assets/a74c1e7ed8c3d0ea-65c90b4dbccbcf82a1835d3f_Whirlpool-p-500.jpg 500w, /assets/c6a04c73d2faf202-65c90b4dbccbcf82a1835d3f_Whirlpool-p-800.jpg 800w, /assets/193270704e24bf62-65c90b4dbccbcf82a1835d3f_Whirlpool-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /assets/9c69b5efe431ee27-65c90b4dbccbcf82a1835d3f_Whirlpool-p-1600.jpg 1600w, /assets/a14901b47e0b649e-65c90b4dbccbcf82a1835d3f_Whirlpool-p-2000.jpg 2000w, /assets/07ee2374522dade0-65c90b4dbccbcf82a1835d3f_Whirlpool-p-2600.jpg 2600w, /assets/297c7c9a9d950cfe-65c90b4dbccbcf82a1835d3f_Whirlpool-p-3200.jpg 3200w, /assets/b7c2061184fe1ddf-65c90b4dbccbcf82a1835d3f_Whirlpool.JPG 5184w\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-50\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-26 w-container\"><h1 class=\"heading-47\">Whirlpool</h1><p class=\"paragraph-20\">Highlander Robotics' second robot, at a size of 29x29x26 inches and at a weight of 110 pounds, Whirlpool sports a Swerve drive, a hood-style shooter, a cable-track climber, and a circular, revolving routing mechanism capable of carrying 5 balls.</p><a href=\"/robots/whirlpool\" class=\"button-10 w-button\">More Information</a></div></section><section class=\"section-22\"><h1 style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"heading-49\">2022 </h1></section><section class=\"section-39 w-clearfix\"><img src=\"/assets/175aa4465c4af51c-65c908a04e251835b4cff494_Selkie.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/assets/b08e197e68a18ba8-65c908a04e251835b4cff494_Selkie-p-500.jpg 500w, /assets/cf9b5b84aa73ca01-65c908a04e251835b4cff494_Selkie-p-800.jpg 800w, /assets/693df4e33241f582-65c908a04e251835b4cff494_Selkie-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /assets/66498ce6946e6251-65c908a04e251835b4cff494_Selkie-p-1600.jpg 1600w, /assets/4f9feb41915a6a28-65c908a04e251835b4cff494_Selkie-p-2000.jpg 2000w, /assets/541fd8fa0537d15e-65c908a04e251835b4cff494_Selkie-p-2600.jpg 2600w, /assets/175aa4465c4af51c-65c908a04e251835b4cff494_Selkie.jpg 3369w\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-51\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-26 w-container\"><h1 class=\"heading-47\">Selkie</h1><p class=\"paragraph-22\">Highlander Robotics's 2022 robot has a small frame fitted with a simplistic square swerve drive, a dual-purpose router/shooter subassembly capable of holding 2 balls, an over-bumper intake, and a two-stage climber.</p><a href=\"/robots/selkie\" class=\"button-11 w-button\">More Information</a></div></section><section class=\"section-22\"><h1 style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"heading-49\">2023 </h1></section><section class=\"section-39 w-clearfix\"><img src=\"/assets/6b11fa20565c0695-65c824a8f5aea133f6b6dcc2_Paddo-3.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/assets/b67d7bb146fa6fab-65c824a8f5aea133f6b6dcc2_Paddo-3-p-500.jpg 500w, /assets/c20d817882e4d423-65c824a8f5aea133f6b6dcc2_Paddo-3-p-800.jpg 800w, /assets/9c9744e3445925a3-65c824a8f5aea133f6b6dcc2_Paddo-3-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /assets/6b11fa20565c0695-65c824a8f5aea133f6b6dcc2_Paddo-3.jpg 1153w\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-52\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-26 w-container\"><h1 class=\"heading-47\">Paddo</h1><p class=\"paragraph-23\">Paddo, our latest robot, is equipped with a 28\"&nbsp;by 30\"&nbsp;swerve drive, a diagonal superstructure, a 3-stage cascading elevator, a twin-counterspun roller grabber, an over-the-bumper intake, and a belt-based routing system.</p><a href=\"/robots/paddo\" class=\"button-12 w-button\">More Information</a></div></section>"
}